what scene from the big bang theory had  mayam bialik feeling immensely stressed  out and self-conscious keep watching to  find out what happy character moment  felt like a nightmare for the actor the  big bang theory was one of television's  longest running and most successful  sitcoms starring johnny galecki jim  parsons kaylee cuoco and mayam bialik  among others the show featured a bunch  of nerds stumbling through life and love  trying their best to find their own  personal happiness the show was adored  by millions of fans worldwide during its  run running for an astonishing 12  seasons before finally coming to an end  in 2019 but making the show wasn't  without its difficulties for bialik  especially when it came to filming the  show's iconic wedding scene bialik  played the brilliant dr amy farrar  fowler who meets dr sheldon cooper  played by parsons on an arranged date  she and sheldon start out a bit rocky as  tends to be the case with most  relationships sheldon gets into  throughout the show romantic or  otherwise but as they get to know one  another their budding friendship  eventually turns into something more she  makes him a better man and once he  finally matures just enough to realize  that he proposes at the end of season 11  amy and sheldon finally get married but  while fans of the show were jumping for  joy behind the scenes it was extremely  difficult for bialik to pretend to be a  smiling happy bride in a blog post  published on grok nation the night  before the episode aired she revealed  that it really affected her on a  personal level because as a divorced  woman it's hard to revisit that moment  in those decisions she also revealed  that prior to filming the scenes she had  been out sick for a month the illness  was treated with antibiotics which  promoted weight gain she wrote that she  quote felt ashamed and that she felt  like people were judging her weight in  appearance despite the fact that she had  no control over it she wrote even though  everyone said i looked beautiful i  didn't feel completely beautiful feeling  down and out regarding her appearance  during her wedding episode of the big  bang theory wasn't the only issue bialik  had to contend with like many performers  bialik had been open about her battle  with anxiety she spoke about it at  length during a 2021 episode of her  podcast bialik breakdown while speaking  with her big bang theory co-star kevin  sussman bialik said with acting stuff my  level of anxiety surrounding performing  is um  very very high  and unfortunately it's only heightened  when she does improvisational acting  something she was called upon to do  occasionally on the big bang theory she  explained and when i've tried to do  things like improv things that are very  kind of free form i freeze i literally  freeze it's like an instant knot in your  throat it's stuck and there are tears  there like i want to cry many other  celebrities including ryan reynolds and  emma stone have also opened up about  dealing with anxiety as individuals who  have to perform for a living even for  the most successful stars it's not easy  and bialik went on to discuss how  specifically it impacted her time on big  bang theory i've had this a handful of  times when working on big bang theory  when there was a certain way they wanted  a line delivered and i was like oh okay  i got that i'll do that in the next take  and i do it but it's still not right and  sometimes it's like the audience isn't  laughing you know it's not funny i can  usually do about four takes or five  takes before my throat starts to do that  thing while discussing her social  anxiety bialik revealed on her youtube  channel that she has made the decision  not to take medication i choose to to  live with it and to struggle through it  and and to find new ways that i can feel  freer to be myself  fortunately there are other ways in  which bialik manages her anxiety she  revealed that she goes to therapy and  practices meditation she's also a big  fan of weighted blankets it may have  been tough fortunately resources are  available to those who struggle with  anxiety and bialik was able to do  phenomenally during her time on the big  bang theory  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

